  "content": "\n\n<h1>Backpacked：貝殼</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>為 <strong>MrCrayfish</strong> 的 <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/backpacked\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Backpacked</a></strong> 所設計的擴充模組</li>\n<li>新增<strong>兩款貝殼背包</strong>！分別是<strong>蝸牛殼</strong>與<strong>鸚鵡螺殼</strong>！</li>\n<li>要解鎖<strong>蝸牛殼</strong>背包，必須<strong>蹲下</strong>移動 5000 個方塊</li>\n<li>要解鎖<strong>鸚鵡螺殼</strong>背包，必須<strong>游泳</strong>移動 5000 個方塊</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p>如果你發現<strong>任何問題，請至 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/Uttj34u4PJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a> 通知我</strong>！</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/Uttj34u4PJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-Server-blue?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&labelColor=0D0D0D&color=5865f2\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>",
